Package: seqseeker
Type: Package
Title: Fast K-mer Detection of Target Sequences in Single-Cell FASTQ Files
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-05-06
Authors@R: person("Ethan", "Fenton",
                  email = "ethanfenton27@gmail.com",
                  role  = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an R interface to the seqseeker command-line tool, which
    uses a C-backed k-mer hash to rapidly detect reads containing any user-defined
    target nucleotide sequence (e.g. fluorescent protein coding sequences) in paired
    gzipped FASTQ files from 10x Chromium single-cell experiments. Results can be
    integrated directly into Seurat objects.
